**********************************************************************
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
*      REPEATABLE FLIGHT SIM LINKAGE                                 *J
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
**********************************************************************

* FUNCTION   THE PURPOSE OF THIS ROUTINE IS TO PROVIDE THE CAPABILITY
*            TO EXECUTE THE FLIGHT PROGRAM IN ITS REPEATABLE FLIGHT
*            SIM MODE

* ENTRIES    PFDA     ENTERED FROM MODE SORT

       ORG     FBR1,D.DATA
PFDA   CLA     =O31
       HOP     ISS          ISSUE STATUS CODE                         P

       CLA     D.KB25
       PIO     026          SELECT T-SYNC DOM CONTROL                 I

       HOP     GRIHC        EXIT TO FLT PROG                          X
